    "description": {
      "value": "After you drink this mutagen, your skin continually renews itself, thickening into large, scaly patches.\n\nBenefit For 1 minute, you gain fast healing 2 and automatically succeed at flat checks to recover from persistent bleed damage.\n\nDrawback Your thickened skin makes quick movement difficult, and your excess skin flakes off with the slightest movement.\n\nYou take a –2 penalty to Reflex saves for 1 minute. Any creature attempting to Track you in the next 24 hours gains a +4 circumstance bonus to their check.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
